translate ru strings:

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "My number? It's for your father, my board, and my lawyer. You are none of those."
    new "Мой номер? Он для твоего отца, моего совета директоров и моего адвоката. Ты не из их числа."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You have a roof, meals and an allowance. None of them requires my number."
